#: SymmetryFunction.md:35
msgid ""
"where $f$ is some function of the $x_{ij}$, $y_{ij}$ and $z_{ij}$ components"
" of the vector that connects atom $i$ to atom $j$. To make it easy to "
"implement such functions I have introduced a COMPONENTS flag on the "
"CONTACT_MATRIX command that can be used as shown below:"
msgstr ""
"$f$ は原子 $i$ から $j$ への Vector 成分 $x_{ij}$、$y_{ij}$、$z_{ij}$ の関数です。実装しやすくするため "
"CONTACT_MATRIX に COMPONENTS を加えました。"

