"elements of the matrix `c1.x` are thus calculated as:"
msgstr "COMPONENTS は $s_i$ の計算用で、`c1.x` の要素は、"

#: SymmetryFunction.md:56
msgid ""
"The elements of `c1.y` and `c1.z` are also calculated in a similar fashion. "
"__In other words, the $i,j$ element of these three matrices are only non-"
